# ---- Benchmark output -------------------------------------------------------
# Each 200k-request ghz run emits ~17 MB of per-request samples; a full sweep is
# ~731 MB. The distilled figures are committed instead, in
# bench/results-summary.json and BENCHMARKS.md. Regenerate raw runs with
# bench/run.sh and bench/sweep.sh.
bench/results/

# ---- C++ / CMake build output ----------------------------------------------
